  "description": "Min-Hyung's lifelong desire is simple: to wholly possess Yi-Jae, the man who raised him. Cunningly concealing his dark devotion, Min-Hyung eliminates any obstacles in his path until Yi-Jae becomes reliant on Min-Hyung alone. That is, before the arrival of a man named Hyeon Ho disrupts everything. Will Min-Hyung's meticulous plans withstand this bold interloper, or will he be forced to confront the harsh reality that some childhood dreams may remain unfulfilled? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
